## 3. Stateful Component Specifications

### Component: Primary Button (`<Button variant="primary" />`)
* **Default:** Background `--color-primary-500`, Text `--color-text-primary`, Padding $8\text{px } 16\text{px}$, Radius $6\text{px}$.
* **Hover:** Background `#1D4ED8`, Scale $1.02$, Transition $150\text{ms}$ ease-out.
* **Active / Pressed:** Background `#1E40AF`, Scale $0.98$.
* **Disabled:** Background `#64748B`, Opacity $0.5$, Cursor `not-allowed`.
* **Loading:** Spinner replacement with `aria-busy="true"` accessibility tag.
